{"path":"/industries/ecommerce-technology/","slug":"industries__ecommerce-technology","kind":"industry","title":"Webflow Enterprise Partner for E-commerce Tech | Legency Media","description":"Webflow builds, named-rival comparison pages and monthly AI citation counts for e-commerce technology vendors, with a report the CEO can forward unedited.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Industries</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>E-commerce Technology</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Your buyers are brand and retailer marketing teams, and the internal case for choosing you is always a comparison. We build e-commerce technology sites that put that comparison in writing on your pages, count who AI assistants name in your category against your named set, and hand you one monthly number the person holding the budget can read in a minute.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where the Comparison Is Lost</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where a Commerce Platform Loses the Shortlist</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The comparison happens on a competitor&#39;s page</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A brand&#39;s marketing team names three vendors and searches them side by side. When a rival publishes the head-to-head and you do not, their table is the one pasted into the buyer&#39;s internal recommendation, with your column filled in by someone else.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The headline numbers sit in the deck, off the site</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Retailer count and measured checkout lift, the figures that win the comparison, live in a sales deck. A prospect searching the category at 10pm finds a homepage that says less than the pitch does, and shortlists the vendor whose numbers are on the page.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The report needs rebuilding before it can go upward</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The budget holder sits above the marketing lead. A vendor report full of activity, with no north star number, has to be turned into a slide before it can reach a founder. That rebuild rarely happens, so the spend goes undefended at the exact meeting where it is questioned.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The comparison lives on your site, in your framing</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Named-rival comparison pages built on public facts either side can check, with the criteria you win on listed first. When a buyer searches the pairing, the page that answers is one you wrote.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Headline stats live on the page and stay current</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The numbers that win the argument sit on the homepage and product pages as components your team updates the morning a figure changes, so the site always says what the deck says.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14 14V6M14 14L20.1023 17.487C20.5023 17.7156 21 17.4268 21 16.9661V3.03391C21 2.57321 20.5023 2.28439 20.1023 2.51296L14 6M14 14H7C4.79086 14 3 12.2091 3 10V10C3 7.79086 4.79086 6 7 6H14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M7.75716 19.3001L7 14H11L11.6772 18.7401C11.8476 19.9329 10.922 21 9.71716 21C8.73186 21 7.8965 20.2755 7.75716 19.3001Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A monthly number the CEO reads in one line</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every report opens with the north star figure, its change since last month, and the citation count against your named set. It is written to be forwarded unedited to whoever signs the budget.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Built for the Category</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things an E-commerce Technology Engagement Delivers</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Comparison Pages Against Your Named Set</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>One indexed page per rival pairing, built on verifiable public facts and the criteria you win on, so the search for the pairing has a page of yours to land on.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>AI Citations Counted Against Competitors</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Gemini are asked the questions your buyers ask, and every cited domain is logged, yours and each rival&#39;s, on a fixed panel re-run monthly.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A North Star Number on Page One</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Monthly reporting opens with the one figure your executive team follows, its change since last month, and what moves it next, in a form that forwards without editing.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Partner Pages Your Team Publishes Alone</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Retailer, marketplace and integration pages assembled from locked components, so a new partner page goes live without a ticket to engineering.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The Comparison on the Page</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Buyers Compare Vendors Before Sales Hears From Them</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>A brand marketing team choosing a where-to-buy, retail media or marketplace platform starts with a list of names it already knows. The site's job is to win the comparison they are running in a spreadsheet, before a demo is booked.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The comparison table gets written once</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>If a rival publishes the head-to-head first, that table is what a buyer pastes into the internal recommendation. Publishing your own, on facts both sides can verify, means the version circulating inside the prospect is the one you wrote.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Retailer and integration pages carry the proof</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>A buyer checks whether their own retailers and marketplaces are covered before they read a word of positioning. Each integration on its own indexed page answers that check without a sales call.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Numbers on the page beat numbers in the deck</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The stats that win a comparison belong on the page, dated and sourced. A figure that exists only in a PDF cannot be found by the buyer searching at night, or by the assistant answering on their behalf.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The argument reaches the budget holder in writing</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The person you sell to is rarely the person who signs. A page that states the case in plain terms is what gets forwarded to a founder or a CMO, so every page is written for that second reader as much as the first.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Why AI Visibility Is a Comparison Here</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>AI Assistants Now Shortlist Commerce Vendors by Name</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Ask an assistant which where-to-buy or retail media platforms to consider and it answers with names. Which names depends on which sites it can read and cite. In June 2026 every direct competitor of ChannelSight published structured data, and ChannelSight published none.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The competitor set is countable</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Fourteen real buyer questions went to four assistants on 15 July 2026 and every cited source across the 56 answers was logged. That produces a citation count for you and for each named rival, on one date and one prompt set, which is the comparison an executive team asks for.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>Machine-readable pages get cited</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>ChannelSight went from zero pages with structured data to 475 in a month, and 385 blog posts and case studies received the search titles and descriptions they had been publishing without. In the July panel, channelsight.com was the most-cited domain of any kind in the sample.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-aj75t37k><h3 data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The number is re-measured the same way</h3><p data-astro-cid-aj75t37k>The baseline exists to be re-run, with the same questions put to the same engines and scored the same way. Each month's count is a before and an after taken identically, so a lead over a named rival is a trend line, and a trend line is what a CEO forwards.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/channelsight.png\" alt=\"ChannelSight\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>The most-cited domain in its AI answer set.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>ChannelSight is a where-to-buy and digital shelf platform for consumer brands. In June 2026 every direct competitor published structured data and ChannelSight published none. By 15 July, 475 pages carried it, 385 pages had a written search snippet, and across 56 AI answers to 14 buyer questions, channelsight.com was the most-cited domain of any kind in the sample.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/channelsight/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-channelsight.jpg\" alt=\"A lit building facade in a regular grid, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Readable to AI engines\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Competitor Count</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>See Who AI Assistants Name in Your Category</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Brands and retailers ask an assistant which platforms to shortlist before they ask a vendor. A call about how the count works against your named set, and what a lead in it looks like on a monthly report.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Four engines asked the category questions your buyers type</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A citation count for you and for each competitor you name, on one date</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Which of your headline stats an assistant can find on the page today</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your Competitor Count</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How the measurement works</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you build comparison pages against our named competitors?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Hand over the set and each pairing gets its own indexed page, built on public facts about both products that either side can check, with the criteria you win on listed first. When a buyer searches the pairing, there is a page of yours for it to land on, written in your framing.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you measure AI citations against our competitors?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>A fixed panel of real buyer questions goes to ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Gemini, and every source each answer cites is logged. That gives a citation count for your domain and for each named rival on the same date and the same prompt set. For ChannelSight, one July 2026 panel of 14 questions produced 56 answers, and channelsight.com was the most-cited domain of any kind in that sample. The panel is re-run monthly, so the lead becomes a trend line.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What does the monthly report look like for our CEO?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Page one carries the north star number, its change since last month, the citation count against your named set, and what moves next. The detail for you follows behind it. It is written so the person above you can read the first page in a minute and forward it without editing a line.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you build integration and retailer pages for our partner network?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Each retailer, marketplace or commerce stack gets its own indexed page from a locked template, so a buyer checking whether their channels are covered finds the answer, and an assistant has a page to cite. Your team adds the next partner from the same template without a developer.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How much of the site can my team change without a developer?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Page copy, headline stats, comparison rows, new integration pages and new product pages, all from components with the design locked. Anything that needs new structure comes to us through a shared channel with a committed turnaround. A figure that changes in the business changes on the site the same morning.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__grid[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k] p[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-aj75t37k]{